# Intentionally empty of ignore rules.
#
# The wordmark font (Rammetto One) is under the SIL Open Font License, which
# permits redistribution — so the .woff2 / .woff files SHOULD be committed
# alongside OFL.txt. Nothing here is excluded from git.
#
# This file exists only to record that decision: an earlier candidate was a
# personal-use-only font that had to stay out of the repo. If you ever swap the
# wordmark back to a proprietary face, restore the exclusions:
#   *
#   !.gitignore
#   !README.md
